  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef is really interested in the XOR operation. He wants to take a sequence A0,A1,…,AN−1A_0, A_1, \\ldots, A_{N-1}A0​,A1​,…,AN−1​ and for each iii from 000 to K−1K-1K−1 inclusive (in this order, one by one), perform the following operation:\n\n\nLet's denote a=Ai%Na = A_{i\\%N}a=Ai%N​ and b=AN−(i%N)−1b = A_{N-(i\\%N)-1}b=AN−(i%N)−1​ before this operation.\nChange Ai%NA_{i\\%N}Ai%N​ to a⊕ba \\oplus ba⊕b, i.e. aaa XOR bbb.\nSince Chef is busy, he asked you to find the final sequence he should get after performing these operations.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤701 \\le T \\le 701≤T≤70",
      "1≤N≤1041 \\le N \\le 10^41≤N≤104",
      "1≤K≤10121 \\le K \\le 10^{12}1≤K≤1012",
      "1≤Ai≤1071 \\le A_i \\le 10^71≤Ai​≤107 for each valid iii",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (30 points):** 1≤K≤1061 \\le K \\le 10^61≤K≤106"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and KKK.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A0,A1,…,AN−1A_0, A_1, \\ldots, A_{N-1}A0​,A1​,…,AN−1​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print a single line containing NNN space-separated integers ― the elements of the final sequence.",
